    "section": "The Two Paths Forward",
    "text": "The Two Paths Forward\n\n\n\n\n\ngraph TD\n    A[Learning Challenge] --&gt; B{Your Choice}\n    B --&gt;|AI Shortcut| C[🏃‍♂️ Fast Answer]\n    B --&gt;|Learning Path| D[🧗‍♀️ Productive Struggle]\n    C --&gt; E[❌ Dependency & Fragility]\n    D --&gt; F[✅ Expertise & Transfer]\n    \n    style C fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style E fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style D fill:#4ecdc4,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    style F fill:#4ecdc4,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px"
