    "objectID": "workshop/skill-acquisition/index.html#reflection-questions",
    "href": "workshop/skill-acquisition/index.html#reflection-questions",
    "title": "How Skill Acquisition Works",
    "section": "Reflection Questions",
    "text": "Reflection Questions\n\nWhen have you experienced the satisfaction of mastering something difficult?\nHow might you redesign your learning to embrace rather than avoid cognitive effort?\nWhat would change if we viewed struggle as evidence of growth rather than failure?\nHow can you protect the prediction error cycle in your own learning?",
