  {
    "objectID": "slides/how-humans-learn/short/index.html#practical-guidelines",
    "href": "slides/how-humans-learn/short/index.html#practical-guidelines",
    "title": "How We Build Expertise",
    "section": "Practical Guidelines",
    "text": "Practical Guidelines\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Strategic AI Use Framework\n\n\nBefore Any AI Consultation:\n\nMinimum 20 minutes of independent struggle (not 5 from exercise!)\nDocument your thinking: What you tried and why you’re stuck\nUse AI strategically: To overcome specific obstacles, not replace thinking\n\nThe Test: Are you using AI to enhance your thinking or replace it?\nRed Flag: If you can’t solve similar problems without AI after 5 attempts, you’re building dependency, not expertise"
  },
  {
    "objectID": "slides/how-humans-learn/short/index.html#your-choice",
    "href": "slides/how-humans-learn/short/index.html#your-choice",
